Dear Talent Acquisition Team at PT DCI Indonesia Tbk,

I am writing to apply for the Electrical / Critical Facilities Operations Eng=
ineer (Fresh Graduate) position at PT DCI Indonesia Tbk. I graduated with a B=
achelor of Engineering in Electrical Engineering from Diponegoro University (=
UNDIP) in September 2026 with a cumulative GPA of 3.43/4.00 (National Diploma=
 Number: 001008202012026100162).

My 8-week Electrical Engineering internship at Soekarno-Hatta International A=
irport (PT Angkasa Pura Indonesia) focused specifically on mission-critical p=
ower infrastructure=E2=80=94comprising 5 weeks in UPS/converter maintenance a=
nd 3 weeks in electrical protection relays, alongside substation inspections,=
 SCADA monitoring, and guided PLC installation training. This hands-on discip=
line in critical facility operations provides a direct foundation for maintai=
ning Tier-IV data center reliability at DCI Indonesia.

My academic and internship background combines critical electrical infrastruc=
ture exposure, embedded firmware development, and automated Python verificati=
on:
- Critical Power & Protection Exposure (PT Angkasa Pura Indonesia, Soekarno-H=
atta International Airport): Completed an 8-week Electrical Engineering inter=
nship (5 weeks in UPS/converter systems and 3 weeks in electrical protection =
relays), participating in substation inspections, SCADA monitoring, and guide=
d PLC installation training.
- Embedded Signal Acquisition & Telemetry (Undergraduate Thesis): Built an ST=
M32F411CEU6 surface EMG acquisition subsystem using a 12-bit ADC with DMA at =
a nominal 4,000 Hz sampling rate, cascaded 2nd-order Butterworth (20 Hz HPF, =
500 Hz LPF) and 50 Hz Notch digital filters, and UART telemetry to a Python d=
esktop application verified with CRC-32 and SHA-256 checks.
- IoT Prototyping & Software Verification (Redesma Technologies & Independent=
 Projects): Developed ESP32 temperature telemetry and PWM motor-control proto=
types, authored technical SOPs, and created `uart-fixture-kit` (an open-sourc=
e Python package for synthetic UART stream parser verification with 130 passi=
ng pytest tests).

Attached are my single-page ATS CV (`Ardhya Novri Ramadhan - CV ATS.pdf`) and=
 official Bachelor's Degree Diploma (`Ijazah Ardhya Novri.pdf`). My official =
academic transcript is also available upon request.

Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the opportunity =
to discuss how my foundation in electrical systems, instrumentation, and soft=
ware tooling can contribute to PT DCI Indonesia Tbk.

